## Per-milestone process conventions

- A folder `docs/planning/sprints/<milestone>/` may hold task briefs and the retro.
- Each milestone **opens** with a planning section (this file) and **closes** with a retro + FR coverage update.
- Every agent **always** declares the target milestone in the task plan.
- Every PR links to the milestone and FRs covered (e.g., `closes FR.5.4 (M3)`).
- Every gap due to missing/partial external dependency is recorded in [`EXTERNAL_DEPENDENCY_ENABLEMENT_SPEC.md`](EXTERNAL_DEPENDENCY_ENABLEMENT_SPEC.md) until resolved.
